"type":"text","text":"to the region containing the feature."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Features come from tiled vector data that is converted to tiles internally, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"feature geometries are clipped at tile boundaries and features may appear","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"duplicated across tiles. For example, suppose part of a lengthy polyline","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"representing a road has recently scrolled into view. The resulting array","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"includes those parts of the road that lie within the map tiles that the source"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has loaded, even if the road extends into other tiles. The portion of the road","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within each map tile is included individually.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Returned features may not necessarily be visible to the user at the time they"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"are loaded: the style may contain a layer that forces the source’s tiles to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"load but filters out the features in question, preventing them from being"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"drawn. To obtain only "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"visible"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" features, use the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleFeaturesAtPoint:inStyleLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleFeaturesInRect:inStyleLayersWithIdentifiers:predicate:","isActive":true},{"